WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Step 1. Open the document or checklist view.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 2. Confirm the document is assigned to the correct family, child, or staff member.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Step 3. Send the request only to the correct guardian or staff member.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Step 4. Review submitted documents before marking them complete.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Step 5. Reject incomplete or incorrect submissions with a clear note.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Step 6. Keep expired, missing, or rejected records visible until resolved.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Verify the result. Correct person, document, submission and review status agree.

